      "author": {
        "id": 1314845
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-13T00:29:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To avoid leaving the key in memory, you can use [`CleanseWrapper`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/common/fpsensor/fpsensor_auth_crypto_stateful.cc;l\u003d47;drc\u003dec0b07f4b1d938abc7e3b37eabb8661c40982e8a). You\u0027ll need to make this a `.cc` file.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 72,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 72,
        "endChar": 64
      },
      "revId": "fab91b49fe966c809766e658498925ae0ab3e1b1",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
