      },
      "lineNbr": 72,
      "author": {
        "id": 1551272
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-02-13T17:09:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Coudn\u0027t we solve that with a #pragma around the memset to avoid the compiler optimizing it out? Or create a C implementation of CleanseWrapper with the attribute set to avoid compiler optimizations. Each seems simpler that converting the language the file uses to C++",
